  PLAIN TONE - everything the app says to the user in this voice
  ============================================================================

  See tone_hype.xml for the file layout, the slot conventions, and what tone does
  and does not reach.

  Plain is terse telemetry. Statements, not sentences addressed to anyone: no
  second person, no encouragement, no exclamation. It reports the state and
  stops. Where Hype sells the outcome and Chill reassures, Plain just names it.
-->
